  "body": "The current text says \"Some objects support being copied and closed in one operation. This is called transferring the object, and is used in particular to transfer ownership of unsharable or expensive resources across worker boundaries.\"\n\nPer @annevk, it is possible to transfer to different origins as well. It might be worthwhile calling this out explicitly because the Worker example only demonstrates that you can do same origin currently.\n",
